{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_08_end","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_08","title":"金错刀","storyCode":"TA-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"e2e0c0a793486d9cba57f39045cf62f60a16ddbf037033c752daefd3018f1b91","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"左乐从界园中带出的奇怪信物竟是颉的一缕生机，椿的矜重在故人影前无声崩解。均将书刀托付于陈。左、莫二人携生机赶赴岁陵，却在途中遭到睚的阻拦。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......差点就划到书架了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是武痴，没有观览赤霄剑招的兴趣。你这一剑若是真使出来，倒可惜了天镜阁这许多书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你也没有把握从我这里夺走信物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到这时，精灵才第一次认真挥动手中的玉笏与枯枝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无数枯槁的藤蔓从地面涌动而出，虬结成一双又一双巨手的形状。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，她怎么这么难对付，你们司岁台的头儿难道是靠拳脚选出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那书怎么背的来着......想起来了——好得很，正好现在又是秋天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“金曰从革”，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......想不到区区盗匪，涉猎倒还算广。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，论及阴阳五行之术，你这数典忘祖的家伙还未必比得过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐，陈晖洁，该你们了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐上前，直扑椿的位置，意在扰乱她的应对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈晖洁向后，拉开距离，只等抓住破绽再全力施为。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫佚居中，一道又一道利刃似的秋风从她周身转出，与那些藤蔓的手掌不断纠缠。\n而司岁台监正仍是面带着淡漠与怅然，立在原地，仿佛眼前只不过是一场她懒得再看下去的闹剧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到陈晖洁一退再退，一直退到那扇紧闭的大门边上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......要顶不住了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈姐姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"云裂——\n凌厉的剑气借着秋风将藤蔓一扫而空，精灵的眼中闪过了仅此一瞬的惊诧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但紧接着，反而是从藤蔓上飞散的锋利枯叶朝三人飞去。\n莫佚忙不迭施术抵挡，枯叶仍然划破了三人的衣裳和包裹......\n那离开界园后一直沉睡着的造物，也一并落在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这便是......界园里带出来的信物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然是伥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"的确是伥。\n棋手从界园中截取了岁兽最狂妄的想象，将之蛀蚀一空，只留一个晶莹的外壳......\n再将兄弟姐妹们参与的记忆注入其中，便得到了这只造物。\n那只小巧的伥质如琉璃，原本一动不动，摔在地上之后，身形却变得有些飘渺......\n而后，悠悠醒来。\n看样子，造物并未觉得疼痛，又或者，她来到了自己再熟悉不过的地方，回归的冲动压过了些微的疼痛......\n她终究懵懵懂懂地朝着那扇门的方向走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此时此刻，只要精灵心念一动，仍在几人脚下涌动的藤蔓就可将那造物粉碎，可椿却无论如何不能决断。\n因为，她真的在那上面看到了熟悉的影子。\n飘渺的造物轻触门扉，而后，仿若一个沉睡百年的旧梦，倏然被莽撞的过客惊醒。\n积尘簌簌落下，在斜照的光线里化作万千浮游的金丝，那一缕生机泛起点点微澜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"众人屏息，讶然于光与尘的深处，似有道浮动的身影，忽明，忽暗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"那影子瞧不真切，只瞥得一袭淡墨色的长衣，像是被岁月浸透的、泛黄的宣纸，却仍残有旧书卷与干涸墨池的淡香......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g5_tjtopfloor"},{"type":"narration","text":"门被缓缓推开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g5_tjtopfloor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把钥匙给了我，你怎么进来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有主人回自己的屋子还需要钥匙的道理？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g5_tjtopfloor"},{"type":"narration","text":"那影子微微俯身，似要去拾起案几上早已脆裂的书卷。\n又似要走往窗边，推开那扇封闭许久的窗，看看外头那株当年尚还年幼的桂花，今岁开了未曾。\n......可她的动作，终是停在了将成与未成之间，凝成一抹极其浅淡的怅惘，悬在黄昏里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这卷书放到靠墙的立架上，那篇文章还没写完，摊在桌上便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小夕送来的画？哈哈，是得找个地方好好挂上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为什么要帮你做这些活儿啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"颉","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？可我听小年说，她的秉烛人还会帮她攒麻将局呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"案台，桌椅，挂轴......这房间里的每一样物什，都在与那道影子同频呼吸。它们是她的故旧，她是它们不肯离去的理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽而穿堂风过，那伥再度睡下，影子便如一滴坠入清水的墨，烟也似的散晕干净，只留下真实的、寂静的尘影......\n和一屋子空空荡荡的阳光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2125_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，她应该更高一些，她的头发是更深的墨色。她虽清瘦，但不该是这种样子......"},{"type":"narration","text":"纵使有万般不愿，她也无法回答心中最直白的疑问。\n可那又能是谁呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那又能是谁呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"精灵怔在原地，甚至对切切实实出现在自己面前的代理人视若无睹。\n她只是直勾勾地盯着那影子消散的位置，不再挪动一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你约见我，我来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你似乎，已经不再有话想与我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到......这世上，还有属于她的不曾消失的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问，这是那些年轻人从岁兽残识中带出的，关于她的一点生机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可若说起她留下的痕迹，这留在天镜阁中的书卷，大炎土地上万千学子——哪一样不是她留下的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"椿秉烛，事到如今，你是否还会笃信，在颉消失后，我们兄弟姐妹所做的一切，都是徒劳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果，你们还能从这世上找到她的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"椿","speakerId":"avg_npc_2127_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请告诉她......"},{"type":"narration","text":"年长的秉烛人逐渐声咽，最终只是一言不发地看着那间陈设如故的书房。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"待到觉得自己已经看清了那房间里的一切之后，她缓缓转过身去，努力克制回头的冲动，一步一步地离开。\n离开这个她最熟悉，也最令她绝望的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我竟也没想到，二哥的念头竟偏执至此，又深切至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......在城门口时的那人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是巧，又见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是......均？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢各位帮忙守护她的信物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"均小姐——不，均老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说您与祖师曾为挚交，我也久仰您的大名......如今得以一见，晚辈深感荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要乱攀关系。那位老木匠去世时，我是否降世还不好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千年过去，仍有人记得他的主张，这固然令人欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至于你，你在邙山镇所作所为，到底是为了止战非攻，还是出于自己愤世嫉俗之心——还需要我再加评说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老天师让你将功补过，这将功补过一事，你是已经完成了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"代理人甚至没有提高声调，可话语中自有一股不怒自威之感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久闻岁家二姐不近人情之大名，今天算是领教了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知错能改，犹未晚矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"均学士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路将颉的这点生机从界园带了回来，感激之情，无以言表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份恩情我们一家都会铭记于心，等到恰当的时机，我等定会报答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您过奖了。这毕竟也是秉烛人分内之事。监正大人乱了方寸，不代表司岁台的烛火就此熄灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她欲守大义，却又困于私情，自相矛盾，最终被执念压垮......今后你肩负重任时，可切勿重蹈覆辙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今后......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过此时此刻，你到外面去，比留在这里看这些旧日遗物要更有用些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘记将这位小姑娘也带到楼下去安睡。已经是深秋了，这地上太冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......书刀一事，也希望均学士能妥善处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一事，算得上是个不情之请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"均转过身，从地上捡起了那只伥。\n仿佛是刚才的动作已经耗尽了力气，她此时又变回了一枚小巧的，安静的玩偶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经知晓，这是颉残存的一点生机所化的伥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"望有意引你们入局，让你们从界园取出此物，便是要你们将其送到这里好生将养，为她的归来做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......就当是我得见故人，情难自抑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劳烦二位将此物送往岁陵附近，不为别的，只为前途未卜，我们一家都会在岁陵外聚首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知颉归来的那日能否到来，不过，既然望将其当作颉的基底，这次聚会，她也理当到场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"望既然在陵中，我便不能不助他一臂之力，恐怕免不了兵戈厮杀，此物放在我身上并不妥帖，或许还会耽搁，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不等秉烛人反应过来，山海众先一步从女性的手中接过信物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，祖师在上，莫佚誓不辱命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"端庄的女性对两位年轻人深鞠一躬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"均在此谢过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"均小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城门那里，你替我挡了一剑。就在刚刚，你又不由分说，替颉守卫她的遗存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，行侠仗义，已经是一种习惯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是为公义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何谓公义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让魏彦吾不至于不明不白地死去，让当年的旧案有一个完整的审判，是为公义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让母亲与父亲，皇室与陈家的恩怨有一个有始有终的了断，是为公义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让那位曾于大炎有恩的代理人不会白白牺牲，为大炎再度争取一线和平的可能，是为公义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为感染者，你自己的公义呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在旅途中见过太多苦难......这片大地对我而言，已经过于温柔。我的公义，理当为他人伸张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的这些公义，我自己一个都没法帮你。但她的遗物，或许能帮上点忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......书刀？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必推辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的公义，与四十年前那场旧案息息相关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此地，我能放心托付这柄书刀，去为你的亲族、你的国家改错的人，也只有你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈家旧事，当年魏公的决断，乃至她曾立业之地的千载记叙，都应有始有终。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是她，曾对书刀的期盼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎的历史，应该由它的子民亲自叙写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随我进来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g5_tjtopfloor"},{"type":"narration","text":"二人走进房间。\n像是重温一出旧时的剧目一般，均缓步走过闭锁了百余年，未曾有丝毫变动的房间。\n百年的光景无人打理，这里还是整饬如初。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书刀再次现世，却未能由你所驾驭，如果我所托非人，造成意外后果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会替你担负这份交予的责任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i04_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i03_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈的掌心缓缓覆上刀身，触及刹那，指尖微颤，似有千万书卷的沉重，压在她的心头。\n她曾酣畅淋漓地投入，也曾设身处地地献身，如今，一切如期而遇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i04_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"她紧握书刀，眼底有什么东西沉淀下去，又有什么东西燃烧起来。\n——那是接过了一个时代的重量，也是一柄刀等待至今的相逢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i04_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"望你......不负所托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......在所不辞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些伥物，几乎是一瞬间涌出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邙山镇地方志记载......一百二十年前，那场岁兽引发的动乱，邙山镇也是这样伥物横行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道现在，岁兽已经快要醒了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......头疼头疼，到底还是躲不过了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个岁老二，怎么这么磨蹭。还得我帮你几次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青砚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是伥怪最凶的地方，要是让这些东西跑到百灶城里去，麻烦可就大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我们俩就守住这个山口，一只伥都不许放过去，听到没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有气无力的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精神点！就当今天是你的高级考校，事办成了，我亲自收你当徒弟，让你的师父倒过来喊你师祖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚辈万万不敢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈，还有什么是我能帮上忙的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还能帮上什么忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就好好地把我今天这几手功夫记下来，回头让你老师看看，比起他的功夫如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g10_wardowntown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等......（喘气）咳咳......等一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*来历不明的粗口*，你跑得也太快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？不是你说时间紧张，一刻也不能耽误？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是跑不动，把东西给我，我自己去送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做你的梦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你个呆子，只知道赶路，你就没想过我们赶到了岁陵，又该怎么进去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当然是找把守岁陵的禁军说明情况，请他们放行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......那你又准备怎么和禁军解释，你手上的东西是从哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......再想办法溜进去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是服了你个呆头蛇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你又有什么办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们进不了岁陵，当然是找能进岁陵的人，帮我们把东西带进去啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"察觉到一股突如其来的杀意，战斗的本能让左乐立即拔出刀来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应要给我的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁城......就在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果太尉真要用魏彦吾的命做代价，至少也该重兵把守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在城中守军都在把守各个要冲，如果有大股动向不明的军队，应该不难找才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，前面那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈停下了脚步。\n远远望去，她看到了一个人。\n一个再熟悉不过的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该来这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
